COMPANY INTERNAL REFERENCE: S_26
SUBJECT: REGULATORY BASELINES & COMPLIANCE THRESHOLDS
APPLICABILITY: INDIA (CDSCO) & EU (EMA) MARKETS

1. GMP & STERILE MANUFACTURING (INJECTABLES)
All sterile manufacturing facilities must comply with baseline environmental monitoring standards. Any regulatory update requiring validation protocols to be updated within a 6-month window is automatically flagged as HIGH priority for the Regulatory Affairs team.

2. STABILITY & QUALITY (ORAL SOLIDS)
Post-approval variations requiring new dissolution profile criteria (including f2 calculations) must be routed to the Dossier Review Team immediately. Re-validation of stability data submissions is required if the authority alters submission timelines.

3. CLINICAL TRIALS & BA/BE
Draft guidelines regarding sample size changes for narrow therapeutic index drugs are to be monitored for informational purposes only until finalized by the official regulatory authority.
